 *
 * Title            : Very simple read/write test on a 1D int array
 * Description      : Very simple read/write test on a 1D int array
 * Correctness      : OK
 * Scalable         : no
 * Generated        : no
 * Categories       : TBD
 * Source           : Own work
 * bibkey           :
 * Author           : Étienne André
 * Modeling         : Étienne André
 * Input by         : Étienne André.
